<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>阅读概览 · GUCCANG</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/reading_dashboard_simple.css?v=1">
    <script src="/js/theme.js?v=1"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css?v=1">
</head>
<body>
    <main class="dashboard-shell">
        <header class="dashboard-header"><a class="brand" href="/main"><span>G</span> GUCCANG</a><div><a href="/reading">阅读书架</a><a href="/reading/manage">详细管理</a></div></header>
        <section class="dashboard-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">READING OVERVIEW</p><h1>阅读留下的，是一条持续向前的线。</h1><p>只看现在真正有用的阅读状态和进度。</p></div><div class="completion-orb"><strong id="completionRate">0%</strong><span>完成率</span></div></section>
        <section class="metrics"><article><span>我的书架</span><strong id="totalBooks">0</strong><small>本书</small></article><article><span>正在阅读</span><strong id="readingBooks">0</strong><small>本书</small></article><article><span>已经读完</span><strong id="finishedBooks">0</strong><small>本书</small></article><article><span>累计页数</span><strong id="totalPages">0</strong><small>页</small></article></section>
        <section class="dashboard-grid">
            <article class="panel progress-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">IN PROGRESS</p><h2>阅读中的书</h2></div><a href="/reading">打开书架 →</a></div><div id="readingList" class="reading-list"></div></article>
            <article class="panel chart-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">LIBRARY MIX</p><h2>书架状态</h2></div></div><div id="statusChart" class="status-chart"></div><p id="chartNote" class="chart-note"></p></article>
        </section>
        <section class="panel recent-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">RECENTLY FINISHED</p><h2>最近读完</h2></div></div><div id="finishedList" class="finished-list"></div></section>
    </main>
    <script src="/js/reading_dashboard_simple.js?v=1"></script>
</body>
</html>
